  "instruction": "Complete the task using command-line or batch-capable tools from Altium Designer, OrCAD Capture, or OpenSCAD. The neutral schematic package `tutor2` is on the desktop. Export a primitive part pin map to `pin_map.json`. Requirements: - `pin_map.json` must contain `total_parts`, `total_pins`, and sorted `parts`. - Each part must include `ref`, `pin_count`, and sorted `pin_numbers`. - `total_pins` must equal the sum of the part pin counts. [Software] Altium Designer is available at `D:\\Altium\\AD26\\X2.EXE`. OrCAD Capture is available at `D:\\orcad\\tools\\bin\\Capture.exe`. OpenSCAD is available as `openscad`.",
